      "writtenOn": "2026-03-04T07:26:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While it\u0027s true that the new tests only work for the in-tree build mode, the situation prior to the `bzlmod` migration was worse: there was no mechanism to verify whether external dependencies shaded into the final plugin artifact overlap with the dependencies included in `release.war`.\n\nIn other words, plugins could accidentally bundle libraries that were already provided by Gerrit\u0027s runtime without any automated detection. The new checks at least provide coverage for in-tree builds and help prevent such conflicts going forward.",
